    {'text': 'Square End to End Pins On Bead Electronics - A Div. of Bead Industries\nRequest a Quote\nCapabilities Gallery\nSolid Pin Configurator\n800.297.4851\nQUICK LINKS\nAutomotive\nHollow Pins\nSolid Wire Pins\nPin Assemblies\nRequest Information\nSquare End to End Pins without Retention Feature\n(47)\nSquare end-to-end pins have parabolically revolved conical tips. Precision tips for lower insertion force mean more dependable connection. Other benefits include: Consistent pin length, Precise cut-offs, Precision level layer winding,and Custom packaging.\nStandard sizes are available from stock and custom pins can be designed and produced quickly and economically with minimal tooling costs.\nSquare End to End Pins with Retention Feature\n(56)\nSquare end-to-end pins are available in a wide variety of metals, finishes, and configurations.\nStandard sizes are available from stock and custom pins can be designed and produced quickly and economically with minimal tooling costs.\nBead offers a variety of features for our square end-to-end pins:\nStars\nStand-offs\nFlanges\nCoined sections\nMultiple features\nMarkets\nAutomotive\nHeavy Equipment\nMilitary & Defense\nCommunication\nIndustrial\nLighting\nMedical\nApplications\nConnector Pin Applications\nMechanical Pin Applications\nOvermolded Pin Applications\nPCB Pin Applications\nProducts\nCustom Hollow Pins\nCustom Solid Wire Pins\nCustom Pin Assemblies\nResources\nBlog\nDownloads\nVideos\nCompany\nAbout Us\nHistory\nOur Team\nCompliance\nCareers\nVirtual Payments\nContact Us', 'source_url': 'https://catalog.beadelectronics.com/category/square-end-to-end-pins2', 'source_title': 'Square End to End Pins On Bead Electronics - A Div. of Bead Industries', 'content_type': 'category', 'chunk_index': 0, 'total_chunks': 2},
